{
    "title": "Spades: The Classic Card Game",
    "description": "Play a FREE Spades card game on your Android device!\r\n\r\nEnjoy the classic Spades card game with a fresh look, featuring exciting new goals to achieve! Whether you're a seasoned player or new to the game, you'll find hours of fun and challenge.\r\n\r\nIf you love popular card games like Hearts, Rummy, Euchre, or Pinochle, you'll enjoy mastering Spades. Unlike Poker, Spades is a trick-taking game that requires skill and strategy to win tricks and meet your bid. Practice makes perfect as you refine your tactics and develop the best gameplay approach.\r\n\r\nOur app includes tutorials to help you learn Spades at your own pace. Train your brain and enjoy a relaxing experience with this classic card game available offline.\r\n\r\nSpades Features:\r\n\r\n- Classic and relaxing gameplay you know and love\r\n- Ready to play anytime with drop-in-drop-out functionality\r\n- Play offline against AI opponents anytime, anywhere\r\n- Use unlimited hints and undos if you need help\r\n- Become the champion and earn bragging rights\r\n\r\nPerfect for Beginners and Pros Alike:\r\n- Over 300 titles to earn and collect as you advance through levels\r\n- Track your high scores and improve your strategy\r\n- Analyze your card play with detailed statistics\r\n\r\nPlay Spades Anywhere:\r\n- Customize the difficulty of AI opponents and the game rules\r\n- Never lose progress with save states, even when the app closes\r\n- Add in challenges like sandbags or hard card play mode for an extra test\r\n\r\nSharpen Your Skills:\r\n- Master Spades with comprehensive in-app instructions\r\n- Track your progress and see improvements with each level\r\n\r\nIf you enjoy classic card games like Hearts, Rummy, Euchre, Pinochle, or Poker, you'll love Spades. Play this free card game and become a Spades master!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Play a FREE Spades card game on your Android device!<br><br>Enjoy the classic Spades card game with a fresh look, featuring exciting new goals to achieve! Whether you&#39;re a seasoned player or new to the game, you&#39;ll find hours of fun and challenge.<br><br>If you love popular card games like Hearts, Rummy, Euchre, or Pinochle, you&#39;ll enjoy mastering Spades. Unlike Poker, Spades is a trick-taking game that requires skill and strategy to win tricks and meet your bid. Practice makes perfect as you refine your tactics and develop the best gameplay approach.<br><br>Our app includes tutorials to help you learn Spades at your own pace. Train your brain and enjoy a relaxing experience with this classic card game available offline.<br><br>Spades Features:<br><br>- Classic and relaxing gameplay you know and love<br>- Ready to play anytime with drop-in-drop-out functionality<br>- Play offline against AI opponents anytime, anywhere<br>- Use unlimited hints and undos if you need help<br>- Become the champion and earn bragging rights<br><br>Perfect for Beginners and Pros Alike:<br>- Over 300 titles to earn and collect as you advance through levels<br>- Track your high scores and improve your strategy<br>- Analyze your card play with detailed statistics<br><br>Play Spades Anywhere:<br>- Customize the difficulty of AI opponents and the game rules<br>- Never lose progress with save states, even when the app closes<br>- Add in challenges like sandbags or hard card play mode for an extra test<br><br>Sharpen Your Skills:<br>- Master Spades with comprehensive in-app instructions<br>- Track your progress and see improvements with each level<br><br>If you enjoy classic card games like Hearts, Rummy, Euchre, Pinochle, or Poker, you&#39;ll love Spades. Play this free card game and become a Spades master!",
